sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant D as DNS
    participant S as Server or CDN
    Note over B: Check HSTS, HTTP cache,<br/>service worker
    B->>D: Resolve hostname
    D-->>B: IP address
    B->>S: TCP + TLS handshake (or QUIC)
    B->>S: GET / HTTP request
    S-->>B: 200 HTML (streamed)
    Note over B: Parse HTML, build DOM
    B->>S: Fetch CSS, JS, images
    S-->>B: Subresources
    Note over B: Style, layout, paint,<br/>composite
